# Issue Hierarchy System

The Gitopedia Researcher uses a five-level hierarchy organized through GitHub issues with bidirectional linking:

```
Encyclopedia Root (Encyclopedia Index type)
└── Domain (Research Domain type)
    └── Category (Research Category type)
        └── Topic (Research Topic type)
            └── Articles (checkboxes in issue body)
```

