    end

    subgraph articles [Article Checkboxes]
        A1["- [ ] Quantum Mechanics"]
        A2["- [ ] Wave Function"]
    end

    ER <-->|bidirectional| Science
    ER <-->|bidirectional| Arts
    Science <-->|bidirectional| SciPhys
    Science <-->|bidirectional| SciGeo
    SciPhys <-->|bidirectional| QM
    SciPhys <-->|bidirectional| Thermo
    SciGeo <-->|bidirectional| Plates
    QM --> A1
    QM --> A2
```

## Issue Types

Issues are classified using GitHub **Issue Types** (not labels):

| Level | Issue Type | Color |
|-------|------------|-------|
| 0 - Root | Encyclopedia Index | Gray |
| 1 - Domain | Research Domain | Orange |
| 2 - Category | Research Category | Blue |
| 3 - Topic | Research Topic | Purple |

